+# KP-1.66: credited known negative answer
+
+Publication checkpoint, 2026-09-30: **already_solved; zero new proof attempts**.
+
+The unchanged `KNOWN_RESULT.md` is the frozen pre-review source audit; its references to review being pending describe that earlier checkpoint. The separate `independent_review/REVIEW.md` now passes its exact-source implication. The theorem belongs to Georgios Dimitroglou Rizell and Roman Golovko, arXiv:2409.00290v4. Their paper is accepted in Advances in Mathematics, with assigned October 2026 issue details: volume 502, article 111133. No independently verified online-publication date is asserted.
+
+The mutually exact-Lagrangian-concordant stabilized knots have distinct smooth knot types, disproving antisymmetry for the original link relation. This package audits applicability and credits the known result; it does not independently certify the entire h-principle construction, claim novelty, or claim human peer review of this audit. No numerical stabilization threshold is provided.
